{"seq":36,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"75dcbcfd-9fe4-40bc-87e7-470558250059","runId":"run_1_1788526438985","result":"The regex has been saved to `/app/regex.txt`. \n\nHere's how it works:\n\n1. **`^(?=.*IPv4_pattern)` (lookahead):** Checks that the line contains an IPv4 address with word boundaries (not preceded/followed by alphanumeric characters)\n\n2. **`.*?` (non-greedy):** Matches characters up to a date, finding the rightmost match due to the negative lookahead\n\n3. **`(?<![A-Za-z0-9])(date_capture)(?![A-Za-z0-9])`:** Captures the date with word boundary enforcement\n\n4. **`(?!.*date_pattern)` (negative lookahead):** Ensures no additional dates follow this one on the line\n\n5. **`.*$`:** Matches to the end of the line\n\nThe pattern correctly:\n- Rejects dates like \"1134-12-1234\" (invalid month/day) and \"2024-02-30\" (invalid day for February)\n- Requires valid dates: Jan-Dec have proper day ranges, Feb accepts 01-29\n- Enforces word boundaries to avoid matching embedded numbers like in \"user1134-12-12user\"\n- Returns only the last date in lines with multiple dates","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":124770,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"75dcbcfd-9fe4-40bc-87e7-470558250059","total_cost_usd":0.136989,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21842,"cache_read_input_tokens":26765,"output_tokens":21149,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":20068},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":21842},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":325,"cache_read_input_tokens":13854,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20899,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":20899,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0